{
  "schemaVersion": 2,
  "name": "M",
  "theme": "mdash",
  "_about": "M-style cluster after a photo of a current M8's cluster (design/photos/ref-m8-cluster.png, measured on a 100 px grid Nov 6 2026; generated by design/gen_m.py, edit that): black, a charcoal card either side, bowed glass rev blades (0..7000 rpm, the M40i's own scale) with a red marker block riding the rpm, the gear and speed in white over the centre line, the tyre pressure and temperature block on the left (TPMS, polled every 10 s; '--' until the car answers), the setup rows on the right, fuel and oil gauges in the lower corners, range, the clock and the outside temperature along the bottom. Backdrop, tyre glyph, side gauges and the setup level bars are one shader (mdash); the rev bars are mtach: 3 effect layers plus the text sheets, 8 layers in all. The setup rows start at x 1612 so nothing sits under the black box BMW draws at x 1406..1597, y 342..419; the cards' top outer corners are cut on the hood's slant. Fuel and range from KombiIF statusRangeTankStatus (config.tankLitres is the full mark), outside temperature from EnvironmentalInformation. No speed limit sign: no app has found that signal yet. 'Leave room for the map' is not supported in this theme. Widget reference: shared/hud.js header.",
